Check that phq9 runs from 0 to 27 and the NA counts.

```{r}
nhanes |> arrange(desc(mvpa_min)) |> head(10)        
nhanes <- filter(nhanes, is.na(mvpa_min) | mvpa_min <= 6720)   #determine max minutes per week
```

